    "created_at": "2024-12-16T10:54:39Z",
    "updated_at": "2024-12-16T10:54:39Z",
    "body": "or use [`aria-description`](https://w3c.github.io/aria/#aria-description)\r\n\r\n```\r\n<td class=\"discontiguous upper\" aria-description=\"Three bytes\">\r\n  <dl>\r\n    <dt>U+2013</dt>\r\n    <dd lang=\"el\">–</dd>\r\n    <dd>22</dd>\r\n  </dl>\r\n</td>\r\n```\r\n**Note:** the implementation is flaky currently\r\n",
    "author_association": "NONE",
